    "title": "Kaya's Weekend Plan",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was happy helping her grandma.",
      "Tomorrow, they would sell lemonade.",
      "Kaya quickly took one ounce of sugar.",
      "She put soy sauce and seasoning out.",
      "\"Don't drop it!\" Grandma said, with an angry face.",
      "Kaya's head was close to Grandma's warm shoulder.",
      "She paid attention to an important letter from a neighbor.",
      "It was about research for a rainy country camp.",
      "Grandma, age forty, told of scary wolves.",
      "Kaya felt scared and sad for a minute.",
      "She thought about climbing a tree in a game.",
      "\"The day after tomorrow, we can cycle and bowl for money, under a million stars!\" Grandma laughed."
    ]
  }
